# moe-ssd-streaming-windows ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** Windows/NVIDIA implementation of SSD-based expert streaming.

**LEONES status:** P2.

## Summary

The project is useful because it provides evidence that SSD expert streaming can be implemented outside Linux-specific environments and can target NVIDIA consumer hardware.

## ODS fit

Its architecture is relevant to the general NVMe expert-streaming strategy. For ODS, Linux/Ubuntu support and independent reproduction remain necessary before treating it as a production backend.